          "docs": "Certain updates on Entity trigger KYC re-screening, requiring an updated kyc_details.result and kyc_details.screened_at.\n\nFor individual entities, KYC re-screening is triggered by changes to: first name, last name, date of birth, tax ID (for US entities), existing identification document (for non-US entities), and switching between US vs. non-US entities.\n\nFor business and sole proprietorship entities, KYC re-screening is triggered by changes to: business name, business type, tax ID (US entities"
